[
  {
    "content_id": "10064001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我这做长老的写信给亲爱的该犹，你是我本着真理所爱的人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄，我愿你凡事顺利，身体像灵魂一样健康。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;一些弟兄来为你做见证，说你忠心地遵行真理，这使我非常欢喜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;没有比听见自己的孩子遵行真理更使我欢喜了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄，你常常忠心地照顾素不相识的弟兄，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;他们把你的爱心告诉了教会。愿你照着上帝喜悦的方式继续帮助他们出行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;因为他们为了主的名四处传道，不接受非信徒的任何帮助。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我们理当接待这样的人，好成为他们传扬真理的同工。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我曾写信给你那里的教会，但爱当头领的丢特腓不接待我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;因此，我若去你们那里，必揭露他的所作所为，他怎样恶言中伤我们。不仅如此，他还拒绝接待弟兄，并且禁止别人接待，甚至将接待的人赶出教会。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;亲爱的弟兄，不要效法罪恶，要效法美善。行善的人属于上帝，行恶的人不认识上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;低米丢得到了众人的好评，真理也为他做见证，我们也为他做见证。你知道我们的见证是真实的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我还有许多事要告诉你，但不想借助笔墨，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;只希望很快见到你，跟你当面畅谈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10064001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "约翰三书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "64001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;愿你平安！这里的朋友们都问候你，请代我一一问候你那边的朋友。</p>"
  }
]